{"id":"vod_sn_36265","vodId":"36265","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"请别忧伤了二之宫君","name_cn":"请别忧伤了二之宫君","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/51128c40026931d5f5e7cd7f65b4b550.jpg"},"summary":"《请别忧伤了二之宫君》是由日本吉川浩司执导动画。在同学的眼中，二之宫峻护是一个标准的硬汉，身手不凡的他和女孩子之间似乎总有一层肉眼看不见的高墙，二之宫本人并不是十分在意。某一日，一个粉发的少女出现在了二之宫的面前，而二之宫被姐姐告知，从此刻起，他和少女的同居生活即将开始！少女名叫月村真由，为了适应校园生活，真由必须要克服她的男性恐惧症，和二之宫同居正是治疗的一部分。之后，大小姐北条丽华也以帮佣的身份住进了二之宫的家，就这样，在突然之间有了两个美少女相伴的二之宫，他的生活开始发生了一系列变化。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6eWwDMj1Kw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4ebhtf7wnm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7Mn7gTW4hX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/btuFTt1F2C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aL2n8USHtw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b5ExrusRTb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YitjJTeFsp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JucGKyfjJN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XGD6XMHyF81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nV9mYVnfbZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wbxDFfaBdC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0v9ds7dnwf1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:24.780Z"}